  "instance_name": "xenophobia",
  "label": "Xenophobia",
  "description": "The meme promotes xenophobic attitudes by portraying immigrants as 'invaders' who are 'stealing land.' Xenophobia is the fear or hatred of people from other countries or cultures. The meme uses an analogical mapping where animals represent humans, but the underlying message is rooted in real-world xenophobic ideologies that view immigrants as a threat to the native population's way of life and resources.",
